ass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 154% of normal in March to April and only 53% in November to December. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 41% on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1953, with grids 22070 and 22670 at 64%.</p>"}
